"cmd-0ccca788c2f34f15","cmd-5852b87f45da4894","cmd-36d88075989742e3","cmd-7d615ba892524589","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The independent node-restart protocol is also complete: a healthy pre-restart state and boot ID were captured, the reboot was acknowledged, the connection reset during the reboot, a different boot ID was observed afterward, and the system, service, heartbeat data, privilege restriction, and confinement recovered. The fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the transition.","limitations":["Write confinement was validated through representative probes and observed systemd sandbox properties rather than an exhaustive attempt against every possible filesystem path."]}
